name: aos
description: Agentic OS workspace agent. Runs the single cron scheduler for ClaudeClaw -- fires the agentic-os cron/jobs/*.md on schedule (memory distillation, weekly digests, curators) scoped to the agentic-os workspace. Gates Slack output by each job's notify policy. Phase 07 single-scheduler.

# aos posts cron results to Slack as the main bot identity. Pointing this at
# SLACK_BOT_TOKEN makes index.ts give aos a send-only Slack Web API client
# (no Socket Mode listener — main owns that), so there's no double-handling.
# To post as a distinct bot instead, set this to a dedicated *_BOT_TOKEN and
# extend the send-only path in index.ts.
telegram_bot_token_env: SLACK_BOT_TOKEN

model: claude-sonnet-4-6

# Workspace root: aos runs against your agentic-os checkout. This is what makes
# resolveAosJobsDir() find <project_dir>/cron/jobs for syncAosCronJobs().
# Point this at your real agentic-os path.
project_dir: /path/to/agentic-os
